  "actual_voices": [
    {
      "file": "voice_00.mp3",
      "request_id": "7448d9adcc1cead4cf7ba75a1c5ab10a6fc1d8aa8d1c115866f31939b254788d",
      "audio_sha256": "1017590ff024e5ccefd22642f3314b9de9a61b52ede335d510c45a46aed2eb4b",
      "marks_sha256": "cf555d8c1246ce2ba4fdd80919f1aef7e591c2659d1dfd29dcaf218dfec61f64",
      "text": "巴黎，阿尔卡拉斯拿到赛季第五冠。可在几个月前，他还因为右腕受伤，错过了法网和温网。",
      "duration_s": 8.664,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 7.818416
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_01.mp3",
      "request_id": "f15c71a7940e66208784502dbb46f9c080bf7534fce00e9928b4b5119fd53f11",
      "audio_sha256": "8358e234e26967aef543a01e49dd12e407ba5513511340e07f4721b94db86df1",
      "marks_sha256": "d2ccbcf35f685d457bf283daa42d98ab6cd3e973592f4f589a324ea8228c0a80",
      "text": "回到年初的澳网。半决赛对兹维列夫，先赢两盘，又被追平，其间一度抽筋。打了五个多小时，他才闯进决赛。",
      "duration_s": 10.68,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 9.846708
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_02.mp3",
      "request_id": "8afeab819e4422cf7feadb1518a8ede2cebef64b36f529ed1913b96ebae44808",
      "audio_sha256": "5e24c652dd7aa89509140ec65153229a4309f3d4a54f17db701ef0175b98ab4b",
      "marks_sha256": "a038d876d2fb42104d605a3bf035576eb35e583b6c22a2797f767d3087e751f1",
      "text": "澳网决赛，他先丢一盘，再连赢三盘击败德约科维奇。首夺澳网，22岁的他，成为男单历史最年轻的生涯全满贯得主。",
      "duration_s": 11.592,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 10.742958
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_03.mp3",
      "request_id": "cfae72725e6cb6edf4f7fc2bf9c850b2f869754c49f4152327b4a1aa45e8043a",
      "audio_sha256": "3f21b52e9b565522c36bd37ed72cac21cdc6960c522ca416a3a2b5232b0c07fe",
      "marks_sha256": "1d0eb831c4430e854057abddcf9e4db977950a6bb6064da62efaede51f38e358",
      "text": "二月多哈，两盘击败菲斯，拿下赛季第二冠。开年的两站巡回赛，他都带着冠军离开。",
      "duration_s": 8.112,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 7.287749
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_04.mp3",
      "request_id": "10183995f0921e03aa6d3d9c2767f443d891be89d3322e6e2e17bf8980c0c8d2",
      "audio_sha256": "be3064b24d262ad867c93992b79deda21411b3d317f4c25bfcbf3328390b379e",
      "marks_sha256": "e48738e51c00c9835023e33a81beb036f6392c8ba22212a40caf1ab739f0f9c9",
      "text": "三月，印第安维尔斯止步4强，迈阿密第三轮输给科达。来到蒙特卡洛决赛，又被辛纳两盘击败。",
      "duration_s": 9.216,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 8.372666
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_06.mp3",
      "request_id": "aedb68ba8eb8ce17c4c731e231c0ab0e68358fd40a07bb3a3e2778a46cf5f4fa",
      "audio_sha256": "4de0f130ec63fc956ee88d35c853e5fccc40bc21a610bd6a4174f6f14d404d9f",
      "marks_sha256": "5dd2d7337aef7cd6e5464eb9cb58656eda2bdc632320719fd4f212d7ecf969c9",
      "text": "接下来，右手腕受伤。巴塞罗那赢下首轮后，他退出了下一轮，随后也错过法网和温网。",
      "duration_s": 8.52,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 7.688707
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_07.mp3",
      "request_id": "b427aec3758ef189babcf5e80cd537a2982e5d950510027c6ac9b5745069fe5d",
      "audio_sha256": "17a0c6df4d9e63aa2af32539d61d725ddf9fbc8ad6b4068977e1e60adda08c43",
      "marks_sha256": "6528f48bd28e67109257fc4203a4f4186b6ff928b3fa30d09609b3ffb83eee1b",
      "text": "四个多月后，他在美网复出。打进8强之后，与谢尔顿拼满五盘，最后在决胜盘抢十落败。",
      "duration_s": 8.76,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 7.948125
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_09.mp3",
      "request_id": "afd730c20b8b05fbbdce7759390bffe950fe2d005266c2dbbaf3be93aee93477",
      "audio_sha256": "c34093ad12275b8ab37ccd62ebd8931959aaea7cc969ab104ca80d0a500c66fa",
      "marks_sha256": "fbb049ea1e14232b64eb52f441fd33f74ecd51e23393495e0bf6452f1be6ac68",
      "text": "九月十六日，他连续第五年锁定年终资格。可伤停后的赛季，还没有结束。",
      "duration_s": 7.2,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 6.379707
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_10.mp3",
      "request_id": "e2231123584bec3f911a3e709a401d331f720c8d4ce79306fb21ad9a9cf0a09a",
      "audio_sha256": "f561cf2615afe06e654bdfc6c5b42162a4364ff832d718a18965206f0bb7cd42",
      "marks_sha256": "0fa77360ad1d8f83e3f8cfde5b97876b4074f2cde98d046d0d75ed86a4e3ab4e",
      "text": "十月东京，两盘击败莱赫奇卡，他拿下复出后的首个冠军。",
      "duration_s": 5.592,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 4.764166
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_11.mp3",
      "request_id": "7af257d03b107e3c8419c0057430451a0110b59cb6157f3eb98923c51ba6d147",
      "audio_sha256": "8f1f40ef7c100b43eb142b2d493bcabdd358a589ba3705816c65d73cc54e7002",
      "marks_sha256": "f9b07c0983b5e973a68461aae94a2c9d96d50000d58e5ca3c5a65e2549a252e3",
      "text": "上海第三轮负于贝尔赫斯后，他在维也纳两盘击败德米纳尔，再添一冠。",
      "duration_s": 6.792,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 5.978749
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_13.mp3",
      "request_id": "ebead02ce77f591187149e7a979d19399a1db3e24d526969e142f898bc311a2d",
      "audio_sha256": "7b3643a8fe8efd2f546443b946e5eb993a4d1157338325c58396ad288a3b6b2b",
      "marks_sha256": "39b37e4abb973bed98a2f6b3b0ca857f5b2321ca69044916946b75bf4f73d439",
      "text": "巴黎四分之一决赛，他先丢一盘，逆转弗里茨。决赛再遇谢尔顿，这次两盘赢球，首次夺得巴黎大师赛冠军。",
      "duration_s": 9.864,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 9.033041
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_15.mp3",
      "request_id": "4a1e2fd609b2bed73163687e62409be69675317475827a68273af8bccece11eb",
      "audio_sha256": "c1a2b4059842c7b17ddd301032b147c720a60a86301e3738e22e5a872542d8bc",
      "marks_sha256": "1b72cea52940a86a73bc0439953c841d5f3b8a4de18eb12e2bd99b1d8443eb70",
      "text": "截至十一月九日，六千一百分，赛季积分榜第三。辛纳已退赛，高亮的是本届年终的八位正选。",
      "duration_s": 8.928,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 8.101416
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_16.mp3",
      "request_id": "db126dcb17fc0a9e0969942c4e126e0cf8ef2e4a7b2fc079640d19653e30dca9",
      "audio_sha256": "da682e2f36bcfbeaab39e3afb5c52e26d8cacb1d9fa4482faf04c7d3acc0a80b",
      "marks_sha256": "6c868b5ce6e2df4b203035c64536efacb050a7017890d41b6e3fc97a3f86189f",
      "text": "去年在都灵收获亚军。今年带着巴黎大师赛冠军回来，你看好他走到哪一步？",
      "duration_s": 7.296,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 6.462249
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "request_id": "19f7facbbda3677bf356cf86c8a744f26e5b896129d896832822f5e2a5bb7dd1",
      "audio_sha256": "f4033df25b923d6ebd3b04d976f5b6566aec60e5f1186ab31d3b1a6c34ea17e9",
      "marks_sha256": "4081d30843ede8b1c0aac3fd6b12ad81be67062206914d78d4c41b8e36193e3e",
      "text": "阿卡年终路，从伤停到巴黎冠军。",
      "duration_s": 3.528,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 2.700499
    },
    {
      "file": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "audio_sha256": "5e79e5655e47efc2c0d3cee79eaeb80b9ff840b05900c74b39a6b72a62d8d70e",
      "marks_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
      "duration_s": 4.104,
      "first_mark_s": 0.0471659,
      "last_mark_end_s": 3.266499
    }
  ],
